<tr><td colspan=2>a rumbling clatter of armor and blades shambles toward the sweet smell of half elf blood and flesh lying on the ground before the wall.  with a bit of confusion the weary troll wonders why dinner has been heaped on the floor this way.  leaning down over the corpse, the troll sniffs the morsal, taking in the aroma, " bah, yus not rottin eenuff to eets yet, dat why yous heer".  looking around to make sure no one is watching, the troll unsheaths his blade, " rallos always say, nebber let gud food..uh..nebber let... umm....rallos always say Boily, you see fud, yus take, never mind if it am sposed to bees someone elses dinner, day shud not hab lef it heer.  ya, me tink dat wat heem say".  with a mighty swing, the troll chops a leg clean off, then severs the leg in two at the knee.  "yus not redy to eets yet, need to bee mo rotten, mees eet yus lata".  Boily stuffs the morsels in his pack.  But, with congealed blood oozing from the new wounds over his armor and hands, the smell proves too overwhelming for the stupid troll.  with a mighty grumble of his gut, boily remembers what exactly rallos always says, "NOW me membas!  rallos always say BON APETITO!".  with that the troll opens his maw wide and plunges his razor teeth deep into the torso of the corpse, tearing away chain, flesh, gut and waste.  <br>
<br>
a short while later, a happily gorged troll sits against the wall, gnawed half-elf heart in hand.  boily ponders the wretched corpses puny life, and how it might have gotten here, as trolls are wont to do on full stomachs.  peering past the open chest cavity the troll spies a deadly dagger in the hand of the half-elf, along with the mask of dark elf flesh nearby.  out of curiosity he places the mask upon the face of the corpse.  "uhhh....ohhhh".  <br>
<br>
quickly looking around for possible retribution, boily lumbers to his feet ready to make a quick getaway as he sees a short, ghostly figure standing in the shadows.  as a rib bone dislodges from his tooth to clatter to the ground, boily feigns a look of suprise,"Gnorm! uh.... luk wat someone ELSE did toos Kart!  kan yus beeleeve it?!?"  though the ghost utters no sound, the troll hears the dreaded scolding that he had become so used to:<br>
<br>
"BOILY!!!!" <br>
